{"symbol":"MAHIP","yahoo":"MAHIP.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Mahip Industries Limited","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Packaging & Containers","website":"https://www.mahipindustriesltd.in","about":"Mahip Industries Limited manufactures, designs, imports, exports, and deals paper and plastic products for packing and industrial packing materials in India. The company offers corrugated boxes, corrugated sheets, corrugated rolls, carton board, carton boxes, fruit boxes, wooden boxes, paper board, paper pallets, aluminum foils, metal rings with seals, polythene bags, plastic injection and blow moulded articles, fibre drums, plastic coating on electric cables, plastic pipes, and other kinds of industrial, household, and consumer products, as well as other types of boxes, cartons, wrappers, receptacles, packages and packaging material. It also provides folding cartons, regular slotted containers, die-cut and heavy-duty boxes, corrugated rolls, and custom printing and branding services. The company was formerly known as Care Corupack Limited and changed its name to Mahip Industries Limited on January 31, 2018. The company was incorporated in 1995 and is based in Ahmedabad, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:38:17+00:00","quote":{"price":17.4,"prevClose":16.59,"marketCap":33.48,"high52":30.0,"low52":3.43,"pe":11.92,"bookValue":-3.83,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":null,"shares":1.924,"insiders":84.14,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2019-03-12","2019-03-13","2019-03-14","2019-03-15","2019-03-18","2019-03-19","2019-03-20","2019-03-22","2019-03-25","2019-03-26","2019-03-27","2019-03-28","2019-04-01","2019-04-02","2019-04-03","2019-04-04","2019-04-05","2019-04-08","2019-04-09","2019-04-10","2019-04-11","2019-04-12","2019-04-15","2019-04-16","2019-04-18","2019-04-22","2019-04-23","2019-04-24","2019-04-25","2019-04-26","2019-04-30","2019-05-02","2019-05-03","2019-05-06","2019-05-07","2019-05-08","2019-05-09","2019-05-10","2019-05-13","2019-05-14","2019-05-15","2019-